107
00:08:15,220 --> 00:08:19,480
When you char the barrel, of course it will darken, it will turn a dark black, but it

108
00:08:19,481 --> 00:08:23,520
will open up pores in that caramelized layer where the whiskey can actually penetrate into

109
00:08:23,521 --> 00:08:26,080
