110
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:29,520
At least half of the flavor of Jack Daniel's comes from the wood.

111
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:35,320
Once mature, the whiskey will end up in one of three Jack Daniel's products, Gentleman

112
00:08:35,321 --> 00:08:39,180
